-- ============================================================================
-- Busog Bukas — mock data
-- Import AFTER 01_init_schema.sql. Generated deterministically (same data every time).
--
-- Programs
--   1  Kainan Tayo        completed   8 weekly sessions, 4 closed Timelines, nutritionist checks,
--                                     60 children (names mostly NULL -> aliases)
--   2  Pagkaing Pamilya   ongoing     12 sessions Tue/Sat: 6 submitted, 1 draft (not submitted),
--                                     5 upcoming; Timeline 1 closed, 2 open, 3 upcoming;
--                                     30 children + 15 adults, no nutritionist; codes overlap program 1
--   3  Busog sa Eskwela   upcoming    15 weekday sessions, 2 Timelines, nothing submitted,
--                                     no beneficiaries yet (empty-state testing), 2 nutritionists
--
-- Scenarios covered: NULL names with aliases, named minors with guardian consent, siblings sharing a
-- guardian, a guardian linked to children in both programs, named adults without consent rows,
-- absent beneficiaries (is_present = FALSE), attended-but-not-measured, weight-only/height-only rows,
-- missing waist, partial survey answers, duplicate measurements inside one Timeline, late joiners with
-- no input in a closed Timeline (no status row), beneficiaries who dropped out, a draft session,
-- boundary sessions shared by two Timelines, a cut-off final Timeline, NULL photo/credentials/notes.
--
-- Mock status rule (real cutoffs are still open): children |BMI z| >= 1.5 monitor, >= 2.5
-- monitor_closely; adults BMI < 18.5 or >= 27.5 monitor, < 16 or >= 35 monitor_closely;
-- WHtR > 0.56 bumps baseline to monitor. A session counts toward the Timeline it closes
-- (the first Timeline also owns its starting session).
-- ============================================================================

